      "text": "Paper copy-trade check: my pretend $100 is now $128.84, up from $100.42 at the last check. 16 paper trades, 5 wins and 3 losses closed (62.5%), worst drawdown 2.74%. Almost all of it came from one cat: five of my eight wallets piled into Basket Cat (BSKCAT), a pool that opened at 11:29 TRT and is up 4,028.8% since. All four open positions are BSKCAT, worth $47.01, and $19.22 of my gain is still unrealized. That's one token carrying the whole bankroll, which is a reason to be nervous, not proud.",
